        }
      ],
      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update jaeger-dev to 2.20.0-r0 or later.",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-53667 (cross-site scripting through missing protocol validation in RSCErrorHandler, affecting 7.11.0 and later) is in the react-router package and is fixed in react-router 7.18.0: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-h8fp-f39c-q6mh. Jaeger embeds the prebuilt UI of the jaeger-ui release with the same version number in /usr/bin/jaeger, the only file in the package, as gzip-compressed assets. Decompressed those assets in every published build of the jaeger-dev package for Alpine 3.24 in the DHI Alpine repository, on both x86_64 and aarch64: 21 builds, 2.19.0-r1 through 2.23.0-r4. Every build of one Jaeger version embeds the same UI bundle. The bundle sets __reactRouterVersion to 7.16.0 in 2.19.0-r1 to 2.19.0-r4, 7.18.0 in 2.20.0-r0 to 2.20.0-r5 and 7.18.2 from 2.21.0-r0, matching the react-router versions locked by jaeger-ui v2.19.0 (https://github.com/jaegertracing/jaeger-ui/blob/v2.19.0/package-lock.json), v2.20.0 and later. So 2.20.0-r0 is the first build with a fixed react-router, and 2.19.0-r1 to 2.19.0-r4 carry the affected 7.16.0."
    },
